# scripts/gsd-dev.conf — dev servers for gsd-dev (`pnpm dev:wt`-style launcher).
# One `name | command` per line; lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Each command should derive its port via scripts/gsd-derive-port.sh so that
# parallel phase worktrees never collide (base port + phase number).
#
# Examples:
#   api   | pnpm --filter @acme/api dev
#   web   | pnpm --filter @acme/web dev
#
# Copy this file to scripts/gsd-dev.conf and list this repo's servers.
